0000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,2,0,1,2.25,0,8,15,15,15,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,70,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,2,0,1,4.5,0,8,15,15,15,1Style: Translation,Duality,70,&H00E4A601,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,2,0,1,4.5,0,2,15,15,15,1Style: Translation Dark,Duality,62,&H00E4A601,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,2,0,1,4.5,0,2,15,15,15,1Style: Translation Colors,Duality,70,&H00E4A601,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,2,0,1,4.5,0,2,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:48.75,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:45.59,0:01:53.16,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Going back in time a bit, we find Zoro, who has recently been sent to the same island as Perona...Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.30,0:01:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this...Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.54,0:02:01.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...a tomb?Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.11,0:02:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who made this?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.47,0:02:05.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was carved from a massive tree.Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.84,0:02:08.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such incredible craftsmanship...Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.05,0:02:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This thing is huge!Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.59,0:02:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So fast!Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.14,0:02:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! It got deflected!Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.95,0:02:44.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Look!Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.33,0:03:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.45,0:03:20.48,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, on Lazy Bones Island in the impoverished nation of Hungeria...Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.98,0:03:24.99,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook was mistaken as  the Dark Lord, Satan, by its residents.Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.03,0:03:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a bright and beautiful morning!Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.61,0:03:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the longarms!Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.98,0:03:45.71,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.12,0:03:54.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.95,0:03:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me!Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.99,0:04:00.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna get hurt?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.59,0:04:01.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Return that girl!Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.69,0:04:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit messing with us, you bastards!Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.90,0:04:06.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let my daughter go!Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.70,0:04:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll send you straight to hell!Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.94,0:04:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.14,0:04:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.64,0:04:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me!Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.58,0:04:23.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know they're abducting that young lady, right?Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.21,0:04:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.31,0:04:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and hex them!Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.22,0:04:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I beg you!Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.42,0:04:31.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not– We need to save her! Now!Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.72,0:04:34.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Satan!Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.33,0:04:39.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They took her...Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.03,0:04:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Satan!Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.23,0:04:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I beseech you!Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.03,0:04:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please bring your wrath down upon them!Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.50,0:04:48.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– We beseech you! – We beseech you!Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.57,0:04:54.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're really dependent on other people!Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.81,0:04:59.88,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,But that young lady is a victim!Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.88,0:05:01.59,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,She doesn't deserve this!Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.45,0:05:03.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.55,0:05:07.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do it since I owe you for all the food... Not to mention all the panties!Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.93,0:05:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.33,0:05:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Satan! – Satan!Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.36,0:05:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Satan! Satan! – Satan! Satan!Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.94,0:05:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Satan! Satan! – Satan! Satan!Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.61,0:05:23.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy. Everyone!Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.87,0:05:29.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Right now, I have become Satan, surrounded by panties.Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.51,0:05:32.25,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,My apologies, but... could you wait a little longer?Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.25,0:05:36.12,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I owe them a debt, and running off without repaying it would be spineless!Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.65,0:05:38.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,So please, excuse my absence.Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.22,0:05:41.79,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,As soon as I complete this single task, I'll be back by your side!Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.03,0:05:57.11,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Birdie Kingdom, in the South Blue, where birds reign supreme.Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.09,0:06:12.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I really wanna get off this island.Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.86,0:06:15.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is the worst.Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.73,0:06:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The birds treat me like a toy.Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.56,0:06:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The humans want to add me to their hot pot.Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.17,0:06:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what's more...Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.94,0:06:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the birds and the humans...Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.54,0:06:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are always fighting.Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should I do?Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.16,0:06:59.44,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Kamabakka Queendom on Peachy Island, in the Grand Line.Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this place?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.24,0:07:06.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More importantly…Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.95,0:07:10.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what's with these people?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.83,0:07:27.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.10,0:07:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.81,0:07:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.36,0:07:55.93,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dear Nami, Robin,Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,how are you both doing?Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.03,0:08:01.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to seeing you two!Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.77,0:08:07.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,When the time comes, I'm sure that we'll become good friends!Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.56,0:08:33.00,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the small sky island of Weatheria, home to scientists who study the weather.Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.94,0:08:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Young lady!Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.24,0:08:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over here!Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.44,0:08:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ship?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.44,0:08:50.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What's with this ship? It floats?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.32,0:08:57.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nooo!Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.12,0:09:01.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.86,0:09:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.97,0:09:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island is exactly what I was looking for!Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.94,0:09:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island?Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.68,0:09:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can save our island?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.15,0:09:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.49,0:09:35.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just watch me use weather science to make it rain!Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.29,0:09:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.00,0:09:41.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, I could do it right now, for the special price...Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.97,0:09:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of 100 million belly!Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.53,0:09:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,100 million?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.74,0:09:51.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's a bit too much?Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.41,0:09:54.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's way too much! No one can afford that!Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.91,0:09:58.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so...?Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.68,0:10:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, then let's make it 100 belly!Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.02,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.49,0:10:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What a deal! – What a deal!Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.03,0:10:12.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are those...Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,soap bubbles?Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.57,0:10:18.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something inside.Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.24,0:10:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Young lady, could you generate some wind with this?Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.88,0:10:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is...Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.98,0:10:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you want it at full power?Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.71,0:10:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.94,0:11:03.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.17,0:11:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's raining!Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We did it!Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.99,0:11:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They sure seem happy.Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.79,0:11:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.82,0:11:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, don't you think that weather science is useful?Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.57,0:12:07.08,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, on Mech Island, Futureland: Baldimore, the birthplace of a certain genius...Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.78,0:12:14.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get him to the hospital, Kitton!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.58,0:12:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.81,0:12:40.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see. He's a cyborg.Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To think his energy source is cola…Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.45,0:12:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should we do?Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.75,0:12:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have any cola here.Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.98,0:12:50.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose. Begin the operation.Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.65,0:12:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understood.Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.64,0:13:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mister!Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.78,0:13:20.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Greetings! You're the young lad from earlier, yes?Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My apologies for keeping you waiting!Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.49,0:13:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Something's different about you.Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.73,0:13:32.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed! Sadly, they don't have any cola here, so...Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.83,0:13:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they powered me up with tea instead.Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.07,0:13:36.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Darjeeling!Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.97,0:13:37.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tea?Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.47,0:13:47.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a super flavour!Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now I feel super relaxed!Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.19,0:13:56.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M-Mister!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.65,0:13:59.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! How thoughtless of me!Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.16,0:14:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are! Careful now, it's piping hot.Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.74,0:14:16.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no! That's not what I was gonna say!Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.61,0:14:20.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mister! You were funnier before, and I miss it!Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.88,0:14:21.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, truly?Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.70,0:14:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So cold!Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.54,0:14:51.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did I get here?Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.28,0:14:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Splendid, a scarf!Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.65,0:14:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.22,0:15:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is going on here?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.40,0:15:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Keep out"?Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.23,0:15:19.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"This forest is a mecha-animal enclosure."Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.73,0:15:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Operation: Surprise Jungle Awakening!Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.34,0:15:59.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Survive and regain the wildness in your heart, Mister!Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.01,0:16:02.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, let's all calm down.Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.85,0:16:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You all seem quite irritated.Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.75,0:16:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you not eaten breakfast yet?Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.72,0:16:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your disposition will suffer if you don't eat properly!Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.42,0:16:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see!Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.89,0:16:17.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is breakfast time!Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.86,0:16:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.63,0:16:26.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dee-licious!Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.07,0:16:28.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing quite like the first cup of tea in the morning!Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.31,0:16:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It feels great to be alive!Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.85,0:16:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not working!Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help us!Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.69,0:17:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Violence is not–Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.29,0:17:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you're at the age where you want to act–Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.29,0:17:25.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you let me–Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.10,0:17:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll see–Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.26,0:17:28.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's sort this out...Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.73,0:17:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in a civilized manner!Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.10,0:17:36.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop...! Nothing good... comes... from violence!Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.81,0:17:38.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Frank!Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.61,0:17:41.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's not working at all!Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.64,0:17:42.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Relax–Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.55,0:17:44.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to what I–Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.05,0:17:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to what–Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.88,0:17:47.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to–Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.65,0:17:49.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen–Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.35,0:17:51.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lis–Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.76,0:17:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To–Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.46,0:17:55.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen–Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.73,0:17:57.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lis–Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.89,0:17:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Li–Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.90,0:18:02.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lis...Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.51,0:18:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super!Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.79,0:18:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think I am?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.49,0:18:33.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am the Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.36,0:18:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.00,0:18:36.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're back, Mister!Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.10,0:18:39.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Per... vert!Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.84,0:18:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.17,0:18:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got cooled down a little, so I'm running out of steam!Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.88,0:18:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a pervert! I mean, problem!Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.01,0:18:53.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um... Um...Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.35,0:18:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Let me show you something!Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.43,0:19:10.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandpa told me to keep away from here because there are a lot of dangerous creations inside!Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.72,0:19:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's your meal!Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.42,0:19:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once you finish, your interrogation will continue!Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.46,0:19:36.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to it.Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.90,0:19:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you've been hurt badly, young lady.Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.67,0:19:48.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you?Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.64,0:19:50.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just an old man.Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.91,0:19:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was sent to this country today,Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.89,0:19:57.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they said the elderly are useless  and put me in here.Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.25,0:20:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to hear that.Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.25,0:20:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.52,0:20:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dissidents are running wild!Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.29,0:20:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The warden ordered everyone to go and break it up!Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.56,0:20:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes, sir! – Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.00,0:20:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dissidents?Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.34,0:20:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, but as you ordered,Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.47,0:20:27.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all units were dispatched to calm the situation!Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.21,0:20:32.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't give that order.Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.72,0:20:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that you even sent the guards stationed at the tower!Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.33,0:20:46.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am an agent of the Revolutionary Army!Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.33,0:20:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imbecile!Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.66,0:20:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care about the dissidents!Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.03,0:20:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let Nico Robin get away!Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.74,0:20:56.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well done.Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.87,0:20:59.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Under your command, victory is assured.Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.74,0:21:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Worry not. You can count on me!Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.15,0:21:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While you're at it, free that young woman, too.Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.29,0:21:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot to kill!Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.86,0:21:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clutch!Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.74,0:21:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're Nico Robin?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.99,0:21:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this place?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.86,0:21:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That smells delicious!Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.86,0:21:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, these are definitely edible!Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.86,0:21:54.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramenfalls!Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.43,0:21:56.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spaghetti patches!Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.40,0:21:58.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hamfruit!Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.17,0:22:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And chocolate rocks for dessert!Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.84,0:22:05.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can eat whatever you see!Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.41,0:22:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, can I eat these?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.08,0:22:11.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead'n.Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.98,0:22:12.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yum-yum!Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.05,0:22:18.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you eat a lot and build your stamina, then the man-eating plants won't attack you'n!Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.52,0:22:20.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really? That's great!Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.39,0:22:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These are really good! I could eat them forever!Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.39,0:22:25.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't just eat'n!Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.46,0:22:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need to work out, too!Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.06,0:22:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know!Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.50,0:22:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I need to eat a lot to become a cool hero of the forest like you, right?Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.58,0:22:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't eat another bite!Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.25,0:22:45.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp'n...Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.15,0:22:49.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fat things will surely be eaten on this island'n!Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.55,0:22:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely be eaten?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.79,0:22:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is impossible to escape from the Bowin Archipelago!Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.49,0:22:57.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impossible to escape?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.86,0:23:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I am the hero of the forest,Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.00,0:23:01.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H–Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Ruins of the Muggy Kingdom Gloom IslandDialogue: 1,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Ruins of the Muggy Kingdom Gloom IslandDialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:20.48,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of Poverty, Hungeria Lazy Bones IslandDialogue: 1,0:03:15.65,0:03:20.48,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of Poverty, Hungeria Lazy Bones IslandDialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:57.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Birdie Kingdom South BlueDialogue: 1,0:05:53.10,0:05:57.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Birdie Kingdom South BlueDialogue: 0,0:06:55.67,0:06:59.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kamabakka Queendom Peachy Island, Grand LineDialogue: 1,0:06:55.67,0:06:59.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kamabakka Queendom Peachy Island, Grand LineDialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:38.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,WeatheriaDialogue: 1,0:08:35.93,0:08:38.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,WeatheriaDialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:09.25,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Mech Island Futureland BaldimoreDialogue: 1,0:12:05.84,0:12:09.25,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Mech Island Futureland BaldimoreDialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.17,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,....Surgery in ProgressDialogue: 1,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.17,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,....Surgery in ProgressDialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.09,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,....Surgery in ProgressDialogue: 1,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.09,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,....Surgery in ProgressDialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:29.45,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Tequila Wolf East BlueDialogue: 1,0:19:23.45,0:19:29.45,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Tequila Wolf East BlueDialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:43.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Bowin Archipelago Grand LineDi